#: Thesaurus.cpp:637
msgid ""
"<b>Error:</b> Failed to execute WordNet program 'wn'. WordNet has to be "
"installed on your computer if you want to use it, and 'wn' has to be in your "
"PATH. You can get WordNet at <a href=\"http://wordnet.princeton.edu/"
"\">http://wordnet.princeton.edu/</a>. Note that WordNet only supports the "
"English language."
msgstr ""
"<b>Erro:</b> Fallou a execución do programa de WordNet «wn». WordNet ten "
"queestar instalado se o queres usar e ten que estar no teu PATH. Podes obter "
"WordNet en <a href=\"http://www.cogsci.princeton.edu/~wn/\"> http://www."
"cogsci.princeton.edu/~wn/</a>. Lembra que WordNet só soporta a lingua "
"inglesa."

